<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to Turf Management - Partner Portal</title>
    <style>
        body { margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f8fafc; color: #1e293b; }
        .wrapper { width: 100%; background-color: #f8fafc; padding: 40px 0; }
        .container { width: 90%; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #064e3b 0%, #065f46 100%); padding: 40px 20px; text-align: center; color: white; }
        .header-icon { font-size: 40px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .header-title { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0; }
        .header-subtitle { font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin-top: 8px; }
        .content { padding: 40px; }
        .greeting { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #064e3b; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .message { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 32px; }
        .credentials-card { background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-left: 4px solid #10b981; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
        .credentials-title { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #10b981; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .credential-item { margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .credential-item:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
        .credential-label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
        .credential-value { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 6px; word-break: break-all; }
        .btn-container { text-align: center; margin: 28px 0; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 16px 40px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff !important; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669); text-decoration: none; border-radius: 50px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(16,185,129,0.4); }
        .notice { background-color: #fffbeb; border: 1px solid #fef3c7; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px; color: #92400e; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; }
        .notice-title { font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
        .steps { margin-top: 28px; }
        .steps-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .step-item { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: #475569; }
        .step-num { width: 24px; height: 24px; background: #064e3b; color: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; }
        .footer { padding: 32px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #64748b; border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9; }
        .footer-brand { font-weight: 700; color: #064e3b; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header">
                <div class="header-icon">🏟️</div>
                <div class="header-title">Partner Portal</div>
                <div class="header-subtitle">Your Turf Owner account is ready</div>
            </div>
            <div class="content">
                <div class="greeting">Welcome aboard, <%= name %>!</div>
                <p class="message">
                    Congratulations! Your <strong>Turf Owner</strong> account has been successfully created on the Turf Management platform. You can now list your turfs, manage bookings, and grow your sports facility business.
                </p>
                <div class="credentials-card">
                    <div class="credentials-title">🔑 Your Login Credentials</div>
                    <div class="credential-item">
                        <div class="credential-label">Login Email</div>
                        <div class="credential-value"><%= email %></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="credential-item">
                        <div class="credential-label">Temporary Password</div>
                        <div class="credential-value"><%= password %></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="btn-container">
                    <a href="<%= loginUrl %>" class="btn">Login to Your Account →</a>
                </div>
                <div class="notice">
                    <div class="notice-title">⚠️ Action Required</div>
                    For your security, you <strong>must change your password</strong> immediately after your first login. Your temporary password will only work for the initial sign-in.
                </div>
                <div class="steps">
                    <div class="steps-title">Getting Started:</div>
                    <div class="step-item">
                        <div class="step-num">1</div>
                        <div>Login using the credentials above and change your password</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="step-item">
                        <div class="step-num">2</div>
                        <div>Complete your profile and add your turf details</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="step-item">
                        <div class="step-num">3</div>
                        <div>Set up your available slots and pricing</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="step-item">
                        <div class="step-num">4</div>
                        <div>Start receiving and managing bookings from players</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="footer">
                <div class="footer-brand">Turf Booking Management System</div>
                &copy; 2026 All rights reserved. &bull; Empowering sports facility owners worldwide.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
